  (text "Stage 5 — main board only. DevKit USB-C programming and main-board USB-C power are mutually exclusive (approved Rev A policy)." (at 18 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0878baf5-4f78-4e8b-b819-cc8aeb6c0a30)
  )
  (text "No bare ESP32, 3V3 buck, EN/BOOT or programming circuit on this PCB. J1/J2 are the verified removable DevKit sockets." (at 18 26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fa70e90e-9a20-4d0d-b48d-dd3cdfeda0c0)
  )
  (text "J3 is universal E220-T22D interface: fit one E220-400T22D OR E220-900T22D. No socket/footprint is selected." (at 18 32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid eeae1547-cec8-49da-b201-a678175dde88)
  )
  (text "E220 M0/M1 use 10k pull-downs to GND (PROJECT DESIGN CHOICE): reset mode M1/M0=00. AUX is input-only, no pull-down." (at 18 38 0)
